H9UDKrmKfpkIJL2CsDCJiX489--MYwS5PCnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuvgFHocLGKi9hWSTFym7tardNG74co6mTHUSavTi4-HA&oe=699C6496"}, {"file_name": "living room goof.png", "id": "519946854176272", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391955_519946857509605_6709902780551874934_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfCyw6WctocQ7kNvwHp17d3&_nc_oc=Adl-UuwafxG4dMlpcuZxIArN_eWtM3aLvh0ew8OWMicAcufXhjJmFZsFQ_y23a_qZr0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuvRKVKBa3dLv4AtrvgU8VH4NYMmv5pJzbFILbdjA_jPA&oe=699C56C3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ABTest_WhiteBGPortrait2560.png", "id": "1213013216859447", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_1213013220192780_1963160557558937053_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PdM1ZnIoQqkQ7kNvwH7tslY&_nc_oc=AdmNuKpBqrdOwdhpMK81JuNjpmAvN22Kk6Nat7JibVeoH-jyncPUc0DJ8PSevviMY5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvc4tBtJGdMw0z-kP2xSPXEak0iPg3ouxex_k5d3rtyqQ&oe=699C4267"}, "display_name": "Stay: Forever Home", "keywords": ["pet", "cozy", "dog", "cat", "animal"], "long_description": "# A Magical Pet #\n\n**Meet Ember, Your New Best Friend** \n- She'll bring magic and mischief into your home, and take you on an adventure in her fantastical world.\n\n{1242411510687436}\n \n\n# A Living World #\n- Ember\u2019s world is full of creatures to chase and ways to interact.\n\n{1278851093944533}\n\n# A Friend Who's Always There #\n- Ember shares your home, always there to play with, care for, or snuggle on the couch after a long day.\n\n{1471237194076810}\n# Endless Ways to Play #\n- You and Ember work as a team to harvest resources, banish thorny weeds, and explore the mysterious Otherlands.\n\n{23905804525715285}\n\n# Collect, Trade, Buy  #\n- Forage resources and trade them in trade for new toys and clothes to suit your Ember\u2019s unique look and personality.\n\n{2661665564036552}\n\n\